# The Pinterest feeds, served by functions rather than as files. First match wins,
# so these have to come before the catch-all below or it swallows them into the app.
#
#   /pins.xml       a year of stills, 11 Sep 2026 – 11 Sep 2027, as they fall due
#   /pins-test.xml  five stills held out of the year, for checking the connection
/pins.xml        /.netlify/functions/pins        200
/pins-test.xml   /.netlify/functions/pins-test   200

# Every other path is the same single-page app, so hand them all to index.html and
# let vue-router read the path. Without this, history mode 404s on reload and on
# any link followed from outside the site — which is every link that matters here.
#
# 200 rather than 301: the URL stays what it was, so /A-H-S-0006--… is still the
# address of that image rather than a redirect to the shuffle.
/*    /index.html   200
